    {
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/document[1]/content[1]/section[1]/para[1]/text()",
      "slot": 12,
      "source": "We have already learned a number of formulas useful for expanding or simplifying trigonometric expressions, but sometimes we may need to express the product of cosine and sine as a sum. We can use the "
