    {
      "kind": "tail",
      "locator": "/document[1]/content[1]/section[1]/para[1]/term[1]/tail()",
      "slot": 14,
      "source": ", which express products of trigonometric functions as sums. Let’s investigate the cosine identity first and then the sine identity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/document[1]/content[1]/section[1]/section[1]/title[1]/text()",
      "slot": 15,
      "source": "Expressing Products as Sums for Cosine"
