      "kind": "tail",
      "locator": "/document[1]/content[1]/section[1]/section[1]/para[1]/term[1]/tail()",
      "slot": 18,
      "source": ". If we add the two equations, we get:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/document[1]/content[1]/section[1]/section[1]/para[2]/text()",
      "slot": 19,
      "source": "Then, we divide by "
