      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/document[1]/content[1]/section[5]/section[2]/para[4]/text()",
      "slot": 136,
      "source": "For the following exercises, evaluate the product using a sum or difference of two functions. Leave in terms of sine and cosine."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/document[1]/content[1]/section[5]/section[2]/para[5]/text()",
      "slot": 137,
      "source": "For the following exercises, rewrite the sum as a product of two functions. Leave in terms of sine and cosine."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/document[1]/content[1]/section[5]/section[2]/para[6]/text()",
      "slot": 138,
      "source": "For the following exercises, prove the identity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/document[1]/content[1]/section[5]/section[3]/title[1]/text()",
      "slot": 139,
      "source": "Numeric"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/document[1]/content[1]/section[5]/section[3]/para[1]/text()",
      "slot": 140,
      "source": "For the following exercises, rewrite the sum as a product of two functions or the product as a sum of two functions. Give your answer in terms of sines and cosines. Then evaluate the final answer numerically, rounded to four decimal places."
