      "slot": 143,
      "source": "Technology"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/document[1]/content[1]/section[5]/section[4]/para[1]/text()",
      "slot": 144,
      "source": "For the following exercises, algebraically determine whether each of the given expressions is a true identity. If it is not an identity, replace the right-hand side with an expression equivalent to the left side. Verify the results by graphing both expressions on a calculator."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/document[1]/content[1]/section[5]/section[4]/exercise[2]/solution[1]/para[1]/text()",
      "slot": 145,
      "source": "It is and identity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/document[1]/content[1]/section[5]/section[4]/exercise[4]/solution[1]/para[1]/text()",
      "slot": 146,
      "source": "It is not an identity, but "
