      "slot": 147,
      "source": " is. "
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "locator": "/document[1]/content[1]/section[5]/section[4]/para[2]/text()",
      "slot": 148,
      "source": "For the following exercises, simplify the expression to one term, then graph the original function and your simplified version to verify they are identical."
